{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/155310-old-white-wolf-publishing-catalogs","id":155310,"title":"Old White Wolf Publishing Catalogs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-31T17:02:14-07:00","id":155310,"title":"Old White Wolf Publishing Catalogs","content":"Just wondering if anyone out there happens to have copies of the release schedules / catalogs from the early 90s to get publishing dates of the some of the early White Wolf releases? There\u2019s very little info online I can find about when books before 1996 were actually released. Probably because that was before the Web was big. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u200b<span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\">Dante \u201cOwns-All-the-Books\u201d Laughing-Coyote<br /> <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/91390940/Werewolf%20the%20Apocalypse%20Reference.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf (and Human) Reference Excel Spreadsheet</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/clouddrive/share?s=VoD6R2UDSGwijaft3H4kbM\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img593/9752/w20supporterhiddengarou.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1765-rderekp","name":"rderekp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T17:59:09-07:00","id":155328,"title":"","content":"What do you need to know?<br /> I have: <b>1995 Publishing (June to Dec), 1996 Game Studio (Jan to June), 1996 Game Studio (July to Jan), 1996 Publishing (Spring), </b>and<b> 1996 Publishing (Autumn). </b>It wasn't until 1997 that both the Publishing and Game Studio Catalogs were combined as one.<br /> And sometimes the separate Publishing catalogs would list a few things like game books and card games besides just fiction titles. Just a few, but if you need to know CWOD novels dates as well, let me know.<br /> <br /> Also helpful are old CCG/Gaming/RPG magazines or Previews Catalog.<br /> Before the Web was big? Pfft. There was a White Wolf release date FAQ on Usenet (<i>I used to post on the Usenet group for Rage</i>). Google Groups should have the old messages under &quot;<b>Coming Attractions FAQ</b>&quot;. These were usually done by Rick Jones.<br /> <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!search/Coming$20Attractions$20FAQ$20White$20Wolf/alt.games.whitewolf/JpUE-h2jKkw/vFWOW6kBFa4J\" target=\"_blank\">Earliest one I can find is 1.0</a>.<br /> <br /> I'm having trouble just trying to find White Wolf catalogs from 2002. As this seems to be the cut-off date of when the catalogs became White Wolf Quarterly in 2003, so not a lot of the Spring or Winter 2002 catalogs were made.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Forgot to add:</b></u> You would also get release dates from White Wolf's <b>Night Edition</b> (<i>Each issue would cover about three to four months</i>). Night Edition started in 1996 and ended around 2002/2003 (<i>Became White Wolf Quarterly</i>). Not to mention, <b>White Wolf magazine</b> would cover it's own material. If it's a review or article, chances are that they spilled the release date somewhere in those pages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 05-31-2014, 09:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T19:48:26-07:00","id":155380,"title":"","content":"You\u2019re my hero, Laughing Hyena.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m looking for the street / release dates of the following books:<br /> <br /> Hunters Hunted, The (WW2205)<br /> Werewolf: The Apocalypse (WW3000)<br /> Storyteller\u2019s Screen (WW3001)<br /> Rite of Passage (WW3002)<br /> Rage Across New York (WW3100)<br /> Ways of the Wolf (WW3050)<br /> Valkenburg Foundation (WW3101)<br /> Under A Blood Red Moon (WW3102)<br /> Dark Alliance: Vancouver (WW3103)<br /> Rage Across the Amazon (WW3104)<br /> Rage Across Russia (WW3105)<br /> Book of the Wyrm (WW3200)<br /> Caerns: Places of Power (WW3201)<br /> Werewolf Players Guide, The (WW3202)<br /> Umbra: The Velvet Shadow (WW3204)<br /> Black Furies Tribebook (WW3051)<br /> World of Darkness: Gypsies (WW2223)<br /> Bone Gnawers Tribebook (WW3052)<br /> Who\u2019s Who Among Werewolves: Garou Saga (WW3401)<br /> Children of Gaia Tribebook (WW3053)<br /> Red Talons Tribebook (WW3057)<br /> Shadow Lords Tribebook (WW3058)<br /> World of Darkness: Outcasts: A Players Guide to Pariahs (WW3065)<br /> Freak Legion: A Players Guide to Fomori (WW3066)<br /> Rage Across Appalachia (WW3107)<br /> The Inquisition (WW2020)<br /> Ascension\u2019s Right Hand (WW4005)<br /> Halls of the Arcanum (WW4009)<br /> Destiny\u2019s Price (WW4040)<br /> The Quick and the Dead (WW6008)<br /> <br /> I think I have at least the month published for the rest. These are the ones I\u2019m unsure of. Any help is appreciated. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u200b<span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\">Dante \u201cOwns-All-the-Books\u201d Laughing-Coyote<br /> <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/91390940/Werewolf%20the%20Apocalypse%20Reference.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf (and Human) Reference Excel Spreadsheet</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/clouddrive/share?s=VoD6R2UDSGwijaft3H4kbM\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img593/9752/w20supporterhiddengarou.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img546/6111/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></span>","edited":{"userid":1765,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1765-rderekp","user":"rderekp","date":". 05-31-2014, 10:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1765-rderekp","name":"rderekp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T11:19:36-07:00","id":155767,"title":"","content":"I can give you the publishing years for all those except the screen, at least for starters.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Hunters Hunted (WW2205) <b>1992</b><br /> Werewolf: The Apocalypse 1E (WW3000) <b>1992</b><br /> Rage Across New York (WW3100) <b>1992</b><br /> Rite of Passage (WW3002) <b>1992</b><br /> Book of the Wyrm 1E (WW3200) <b>1993</b><br /> Caerns: Places of Power (WW3201) <b>1993</b><br /> Rage Across the Amazon (WW3104) <b>1993</b><br /> Rage Across Russia (WW3105) <b>1993</b><br /> Umbra: The Velvet Shadow (WW3204) <b>1993</b><br /> Under A Blood Red Moon (WW3102) <b>1993</b><br /> Valkenburg Foundation (WW3101) <b>1993</b><br /> Ways of the Wolf (WW3050) <b>1993</b><br /> Werewolf Players Guide 1E (WW3202) <b>1993</b><br /> Who\u2019s Who Among Werewolves: Garou Saga (WW3401) <b>1994</b><br /> World of Darkness: Gypsies (WW2223) <b>1994</b><br /> Tribebook: Black Furies 2E (WW3051) <b>1994</b><br /> Tribebook: Bone Gnawers 2E (WW3052) <b>1994</b><br /> Tribebook: Children of Gaia 2E (WW3053) <b>1994</b><br /> Tribebook: Red Talons 2E (WW3057) <b>1995</b><br /> Tribebook: Shadow Lords 2E (WW3058) <b>1995</b><br /> Ascension\u2019s Right Hand (WW4005) <b>1995</b><br /> Dark Alliance: Vancouver (WW3103) <b>1995</b><br /> Destiny\u2019s Price (WW4040) <b>1995</b><br /> Freak Legion: A Players Guide to Fomori (WW3066) <b>1995</b><br /> Halls of the Arcanum (WW4009) <b>1995</b><br /> The Inquisition (WW2020) <b>1995</b><br /> The Quick and the Dead (WW6008) <b>1995</b><br /> Rage Across Appalachia (WW3107) <b>1995</b><br /> World of Darkness: Outcasts: A Players Guide to Pariahs (WW3065) <b>1995</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 06-01-2014, 02:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T12:29:18-07:00","id":155836,"title":"","content":"What I've gotten so far (<i>sometimes all the catalogs that I have give out are years, so I had to do some more digging than that since they give no dates for previously released books</i>):<br /> <br /> The Inquisition (WW2020) July 1995 (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/alt.games.whitewolf/1995$20books/alt.games.whitewolf/woCCngqSgYs/GXN6-2ErrXoJ\" target=\"_blank\">This thread</a>)<br /> World of Darkness: Gypsies (WW2223) Sept. 1994 (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/alt.games.whitewolf/Release$20Schedule/alt.games.whitewolf/Q4c5DlVVpe8/56sGTWyW0HwJ\" target=\"_blank\">From Sam Chupp\u2019s List</a>) <b>White Wolf Magazine #49 says this came out in Nov.</b><br /> Storyteller\u2019s Screen (WW3001) Feb. 4, 1992<br /> Bone Gnawers Tribebook (WW3052) April 1994 (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/alt.games.whitewolf/Release$20Schedule/alt.games.whitewolf/Q4c5DlVVpe8/56sGTWyW0HwJ\" target=\"_blank\">From Sam Chupp\u2019s list</a>)<br /> Who\u2019s Who Among Werewolves: Garou Saga (WW3401) Sept. 1994 (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/alt.games.whitewolf/Release$20Schedule/alt.games.whitewolf/Q4c5DlVVpe8/56sGTWyW0HwJ\" target=\"_blank\">From Sam Chupp\u2019s list</a>) <b>White Wolf Magazine #48 says this came out in Oct.</b><br /> Children of Gaia Tribebook (WW3053) Nov. 1994 (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/alt.games.whitewolf/Release$20Schedule/alt.games.whitewolf/Q4c5DlVVpe8/56sGTWyW0HwJ\" target=\"_blank\">From Sam Chupp\u2019s list</a>) <b>White Wolf Magazine #49 says this came out in Nov.</b><br /> Red Talons Tribebook (WW3057) Jan. 1996 <b>(1996 Jan-Jun. Catalog confirms this as &quot;Winter '96&quot;)</b><br /> Shadow Lords Tribebook (WW3058) April 29, 1996 <b>(1996 Jan-Jun. Catalog confirms this as &quot;Spring '96&quot;)</b><br /> Rage Across Appalachia (WW3107) Nov. 1995 (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/alt.games.whitewolf/1995$20books/alt.games.whitewolf/woCCngqSgYs/GXN6-2ErrXoJ\" target=\"_blank\">This thread</a>)<br /> Freak Legion: A Players Guide to Fomori (WW3066) Dec. 1995<br /> Ascension\u2019s Right Hand (WW4005) 1/95 (From the Coming Attractions FAQ posts)<br /> Halls of the Arcanum (WW4009) 5/95 (From the Coming Attractions FAQ posts)<br /> Destiny\u2019s Price (WW4040) Dec. 1995<br /> The Quick and the Dead (WW6008) June 1995 (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/alt.games.whitewolf/1995$20books/alt.games.whitewolf/woCCngqSgYs/GXN6-2ErrXoJ\" target=\"_blank\">This thread</a>)<br /> <br /> I clearly remember the Red Talons Tribebook being out around 1996 because I had gotten into reading the books thanks to the Rage CCG (1995). I started out on the novels first and then Red Talons was my first W:tA RPG book that I got.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 06-02-2014, 12:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T17:28:55-07:00","id":156100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> 